@startuml getLocalPortOfTheProtocol
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getLocalPortOfTheProtocol – Retrieve Local TCP Server Port by Protocol
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Server Interface" as tsr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - protocol
end note

requestor -> tsr: (protocol)
activate tsr

tsr -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tsr: TCP server LTP list
deactivate jd

note over tsr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate TCP server LTPs  
  - Match tcp-server-interface protocol  
  - Read local-port from:
    tcp-server-interface-configuration  
  - Return local port if found  
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

tsr --> requestor: localPort | undefined
deactivate tsr

@enduml
